 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tamagawa-san Detemashita?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "玉川さん出てました？"
   },
   {
    "en": "Tamagawa-san, Did You Appear?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The popular AV actress Miyama Yuri has suddenly announced her retirement.\n\nAt the same time, Shikishima, a convenience store manager and her biggest fan, finds himself at a loss—unsure of how to move forward without her in the industry.\n\nAmidst this, a girl named Tamagawa-san shows up, applying for a job at Shikishima's store. Coincidentally, she bears a striking resemblance to Miyama Yuri.\n\nThis uncanny similarity leaves Shikishima torn. Should he ask Tamagawa-san if she's ever appeared in AVs? But in today’s politically sensitive climate, such a question feels risky…\n\nWho is Tamagawa-san really?",
   "ja": "人気AV女優・美やま ゆりが電撃引退を発表。\n彼女の大ファンであるコンビニ店長・敷島は絶望していた！\n\nそんな最中バイトの面接にやってきたのは、美やま ゆりに激似の玉川さん！\n本人かどうか聞いてみたい……「玉川さん 出てました?」と聞いてみたい!!\nでもこの大コンプラ時代にそんなこと聞けるはずもなく……。\n\n果たして玉川さんの正体は……!?\n笑撃のコンビニ×AVコメディー、撮影開始！"
  },
